OL,3,GNEWSASeven attempted murder arrests
OL,4,Aafter street fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after a
OL,8,Fman was stabbed during a street fight
OL,9,Finvolving a knife and a hammer in
OL,10,FDerby.
OL,12,FDerbyshire Police said officers were
OL,13,Fcalled to the fight between two groups
OL,14,Fin Vincent Street, Normanton, at about
OL,15,F20:55 BST on Monday.
OL,17,FThe man, 20, was taken to hospital with
OL,18,Flife-threatening injuries but is now in
OL,19,Fa stable condition, and a 17-year-old
OL,20,Fboy and a man, 20, sustained head
OL,21,Finjuries, which are not thought to be
OL,22,Fserious, police said.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
