OL,3,GNEWSASeven attempted murder arrests
OL,4,Aafter street fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers later found the suspects in
OL,7,Ftwo vehicles in Sutton-in-Ashfield,
OL,8,FNottinghamshire, where they recovered a
OL,9,Fknife and arrested four 16-year-old
OL,10,Fboys, and three men - two aged 20 and
OL,11,Fone aged 19.
